1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,900
Someone needs to say something.

2
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:08,360
The idiot who does the scheduling at the funeral home should be fired.

3
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,720
Liu Min couldn't have done anything.

4
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,860
Why can't they see that?

5
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:17,160
There's a lot women are better off not knowing.

6
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:18,980
Now get out.

7
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,000
I need to talk with Mr. Chen.

8
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,240
By the way, Mr. Chen, thank you for what you did for my husband.

9
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,760
I'm sorry it happened.

10
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:32,520
It's fine, ma'am. We all take and give.

11
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:35,780
Damn it!

12
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,340
First they investigate Liu Shu.

13
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,380
Then they go after Liu Min.

14
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,640
Someone is gunning for me!

15
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,980
The only positive here is that my worthless son is no longer my problem.

16
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,220
Right, now then.

17
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,320
You get Liu Min's phone?

18
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:52,900
About that. It's gone.

19
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,860
What? Where is it?

20
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:56,780
Chen Jin.

21
00:00:57,580 --> 00:01:01,380
You're not a man who makes mistakes, so quit dicking me around.

22
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,800
You wound me, sir.

23
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:08,380
I'm not interested in your family's secrets, and I can assure you that the police don't have the phone either.

24
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:09,220
Fine.

25
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,080
You have one more chance.

26
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:12,840
Get it back to me soon.

27
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:15,880
My patience only goes so far.

28
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:21,060
You're a mad genius, boss.

29
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:24,680
That handoff you set up took me for a loop, but it was the right call.

30
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:28,160
So since the cops don't have anything on me, when do I get out?

31
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:29,820
When your holding period is up.

32
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:33,140
Tell me about the handoff.

33
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,360
How did it go?

34
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:40,780
That guy in the stairwell.

35
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,200
That was all you, right?

36
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:44,680
I passed the phone off to them.

37
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,380
Now when I'm caught, I'm clean.

38
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,820
And we leave the cops with nothing.

39
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,040
Just fill me in next time.

40
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,280
I didn't expect anyone.

41
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:55,800
Especially not there.

42
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,240
Hey!

43
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:01,300
Hey!

44
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,740
Oh!

45
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:08,120
It's just you.

46
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:10,960
Nearly gave me a heart attack, I swear.

47
00:02:11,780 --> 00:02:12,600
So what's up?

48
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,980
The boss not trust you without a babysitter?

49
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:15,860
Ha!

50
00:02:16,420 --> 00:02:18,480
Well, I'm telling you right now.

51
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:19,820
I don't need you here.

52
00:02:21,420 --> 00:02:21,940
Okay.

53
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,500
What's that supposed to mean?

54
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:28,660
Oh, I see.

55
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,700
Damn, that is good.

56
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,840
Really thinking ahead.

57
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:36,160
You take care of that now.

58
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:40,520
Creepy little ninja almost got his neck snapped.

59
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:46,860
What?

60
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,240
What?

